<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco de A. Edwards cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco de A. Edwards cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment analysts Laura Berdeja and Valentin Carril have cut their rating for Chile's Banco de A. Edwards to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- In an April 23 analysis, they wrote that they were reducing the rating because of valuation.</p>
<p>-- They kept their 12- to 18-month price target of $22.50.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were down 1/8 to 20-7/8 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
